  "fidelity_notes": [
    "The released mathqa.py names math-verify 0.9.0, latex2sympy2_extended 1.11.0 and antlr4-python3-runtime 4.13.2. SymPy and the remaining dependency versions are declared reproduction choices because upstream inherited them from an unspecified environment.",
    "The official Google IFEval checker and dataset source revision is pinned. The original experiment referenced an unreleased weightenv adapter; identical upstream adapter behavior is not claimed.",
    "NLTK 3.10.4 redirects the official English Punkt pickle URI to verified non-pickle punkt_tab tables. Langdetect and checker randomness use seed 0; these choices are declared because upstream randomness was not pinned.",
    "Installation is separate and uses scorer-requirements.txt with --require-hashes. Loading verifies installed distribution versions and local source/resource bytes, but is not remote image or installed-wheel-byte attestation."
